WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.590
- You're around athletes a lot.

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:04.290
So many of them have
pregame rituals. Right?

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:06.030
So what do you do before
you hit the field?

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:07.160
Like for interviews? What do you do?

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:09.310
- So what I do before I hit the field,

00:00:09.310 --> 00:00:10.520
I always call my dad because--

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.520
- I love this about you.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.070
- I know, I love that. Thank you.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.090
Yeah, he's my best friend.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:15.570
And he knows so much about sports,

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.380
and like he's the one that
got me interested in it.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.200
Used to tell me all the
stories all the time

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.380
about the athletes, the
coaches, all the things.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.632
And then I listened to
really dirty rap music.

00:00:24.632 --> 00:00:25.465
(kelly laughing)

00:00:25.465 --> 00:00:26.560
Really explicit.

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:28.340
- You're like Gweneth Paltrow.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.900
She was on here and
asked her favorite song,

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.190
and she said, "WP."

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:32.240
- Yeah! Or "Up."

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.350
But I love like the pre,
pre-game before the fans come in

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:37.870
and the guys are just warming up,

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:40.090
when they're FaceTiming their
families and all the things.

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:41.830
They like to put on their music.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:43.787
And so I'm always like going
to talk to somebody I'm like,

00:00:43.787 --> 00:00:44.960
"Hold on, let me Shazam this."

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.371
It's like, "Oo, this is dirty and fun."

00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:49.484
(audience laughing)

00:00:49.484 --> 00:00:50.317
I love this.

00:00:50.317 --> 00:00:51.884
- Wait, who's like your
favorite to listen to?

00:00:51.884 --> 00:00:54.130
- I don't know anyone
who's just like, really...

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.670
- I like Kendrick Lamar.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.410
- Yes! So do I. So do I.

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:58.655
Cardi B's fantastic.

00:00:58.655 --> 00:01:00.430
I'll never know all the words.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:01.760
Nicki Minaj. Fantastic.

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.780
Like, just the fact that they, you know,

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:04.900
all the beats and everything.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.980
And I think I'm so cool
when I listened to it.

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.550
I pretend I'm a football player so.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.010
- Oh my god. I pretend I'm them,

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:10.843
like while they're singing,

00:01:10.843 --> 00:01:14.440
cause it takes God,
Jesus, the Holy Spirit,

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:16.170
everything to keep me on a treadmill.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.920
And also, also rap music.

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.010
No, I just used to love it.

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:20.937
And now I don't and I'm just like,

00:01:20.937 --> 00:01:21.960
"Oh my god, there's so many things

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:22.920
I'd rather be doing right now.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.559
But, Okay. Cool, for my heart, whatever."

00:01:24.559 --> 00:01:26.400
But like, so I do it

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.040
and I listen to a lot
of Kendrick and Cardi.

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.460
They're good to listen
to, but I feel bad ass.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:31.300
I have to feel bad ass.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:32.133
- That's what I'm saying.

00:01:32.133 --> 00:01:34.880
And I like to feel that
way before I go in front

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:35.940
of the camera to do a game.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.100
And I also to make me feel like a kid,

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.280
I eat like one of those Uncrustables,

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:42.466
like a peanut butter and
jelly sandwich, because--

00:01:42.466 --> 00:01:43.830
- I've heard this about you.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.290
Actually, you take kid
snack food for your food.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:48.123
It's awesome.

00:01:48.123 --> 00:01:49.000
- Well, think about it. Down on the field,

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.410
I don't have much time cause
I'm running in after a coach

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:52.790
or I'm running out with a coach.

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:53.800
I can't it's...

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.110
I used to back in the day,

00:01:55.110 --> 00:01:57.540
I'll crush a hot dog or chicken
fingers or all the things,

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:58.690
but I don't have time.

00:01:58.690 --> 00:01:59.810
Uncrustables are so easy.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:02.360
They come in that plastic wrap
and you can just eat so fast.

00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:03.930
And what's better than a PB and J

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.730
when you're standing there for seven hours

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:06.810
and you need something to eat.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:07.643
- Yeah. Something.

00:02:07.643 --> 00:02:09.130
Yes. Well, I heard this about you.

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.790
So I stole some food from my son's lunch.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:12.680
I brought you...

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:15.260
- I love you. What flavor? Do you know?

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.910
- It's a secret. It's a surprise.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:21.490
- You just have the best
snacks when you come here.

